<!DOCTYPE net>
<net X="100" Y="100">
  <!-- The vyhybna station (two station tracks) with an automatic block section on the open line to the
       west (o1, o2, o3 all face east) and a two-block-deep throat to the east (t2, t1, hB all face west).
       Station tracks: (16,8)-(25,8) and (17,9)-(24,9). Blocks (6,8)-(9,8) and (28,8)-(31,8) are
       signal-bounded but are not station tracks: their end signals face the same way. -->
